# Web Push (#267) — closed-app notification delivery.
# PUBLIC half of a VAPID keypair (base64url, uncompressed P-256 point). Public by
# design: it is the applicationServerKey the push service uses to accept only
# this deployment's sends. Leave unset and the opt-in stays hidden — the app is
# unchanged. The PRIVATE half is a true secret and lives ONLY in the Cloudflare
# Pages Function store (never here, never a VITE_* var):
#   wrangler pages secret put VAPID_PRIVATE   # + VAPID_PUBLIC, VAPID_SUBJECT, PUSH_ENABLED=true
# VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC=
